title: waking_up_start
tags: story tutorial intro
---
Lightheaded. Nothing but a high pitched sound deep in my ear. Blurry, overexposed, shapeless blobs of light floating in front of me. Can't feel my fingers, can't move my head, can't remember anything at all. The sharp smell of metallic blood and artificial sweetener enters my nostrils simultaneously. #line:waking_up_start_00
-> Try to move #line:waking_up_start_01
    <<jump waking_up_syringe>>
===

title: waking_up_syringe
tags: 
---
A sharp syringe from my periphery punctures my neck. I feel the rush immediately, and the uncontrollable urge to vomit. #line:waking_up_syringe_00
-> Vomit #line:waking_up_syringe_01
    <<jump waking_up_first_breath>>
===

title: waking_up_first_breath
tags: 
---
As the pod slowly drains and fills with air, I puke out everything and take my first breath. #line:waking_up_first_breath_00
-> Look Around #line:waking_up_first_breath_01
    <<jump waking_up_look_around>>
===

title: waking_up_look_around
tags: 
---
As my vision clears, in front of me, through the glass pane, is a room full of cryo pods; some empty, most full. The initials A.R.K plastered all over the walls. #line:waking_up_look_around_00
-> Try to move #line:waking_up_look_around_01
    <<jump waking_up_collapse>>
-> Recall the initials #line:waking_up_look_around_02
    <<jump waking_up_recall_ark>>
===

title: waking_up_recall_ark
tags: 
---
The A.R.K expedition. I'm part of it. It was supposed to save humanity or something. A long time must have passed if we made it to our destination. #line:waking_up_recall_ark_00
-> Try to move #line:waking_up_recall_ark_01
    <<jump waking_up_collapse>>
===

title: waking_up_collapse
tags: 
---
The glass pane slides open. Legs still weak. I collapse forward onto my knees and hands. Out the corner of my eye, a familiar face I can't fully remember. #line:waking_up_collapse_00 #portrait:speaker_nora
"Welcome back, captain." #line:waking_up_collapse_01 #portrait:speaker_nora
-> Where am I? #line:waking_up_collapse_02
    <<jump waking_up_nora_briefing>>
-> Who are you? #line:waking_up_collapse_03
    <<jump waking_up_nora_briefing>>
-> Who am I? #line:waking_up_collapse_04
    <<jump waking_up_nora_briefing>>
===

title: waking_up_nora_briefing
tags: 
---
"Not the time for jokes, captain. The hull of the ARK is breached by an unknown entity. We have to neutralize it." #line:waking_up_nora_briefing_00 #portrait:speaker_nora
-> Understood #line:waking_up_nora_briefing_01
    <<set_fact intro_awake true>>
    <<queue_beat beat_choose_start_ship>>
    <<stop>>
===

